menu "Pilot Kit Box"

    config PK_BLE_ENABLED
        bool "Initialise BLE GATT server at boot"
        default y
        help
            When enabled, app_main() calls ble_gatt_init() which kicks
            NimBLE on top of the ESP-Hosted VHCI transport. The BT
            controller lives on the on-board ESP32-C6 and the host
            talks to it over SDIO.

            Requires that the C6 has the matching esp-hosted-mcu
            slave firmware flashed first (one-time per board — see
            docs/hardware/c6_slave_firmware.md). Without that, NimBLE
            init will abort. Turn this OFF for CI runners or while
            developing data-path features that don't need BLE.

    config PK_OWN_ICAO
        hex "Own aircraft ICAO24 (0 = disabled)"
        default 0x000000
        range 0x000000 0xFFFFFF
        help
            24-bit Mode-S ICAO address of the aircraft this Pilot Kit
            is installed in. When non-zero, the PFD pulls altitude /
            vertical speed / ground speed from ADS-B reports matching
            this ICAO. Leave 0 to disable; ALT / VS / GS will show "--".

            Changing this value requires a rebuild + reflash.

    config PK_OWN_STALE_AGE_MS
        int "Own-ship data stale threshold (ms)"
        default 5000
        range 500 60000
        help
            How long after the last own-ship ADS-B message we keep
            displaying its altitude / VS / GS. Typical transponders
            broadcast position/velocity at 1-2 Hz, so 5 s is generous.

    config PK_SOC_TEMP_WARN_C
        int "SoC over-temperature warning threshold (C)"
        default 85
        range 40 98
        help
            Top-bar TEMP indicator lights up above this SoC die temperature
            and clears 7 C below it (hysteresis, so it does not flicker).

            Capped at 98 C because the sensor runs in the [20, 100] hardware
            range (P4 offers only fixed ranges; see soc_temp.c). A threshold
            at or above the range ceiling could never be reached.

            This is a PROXY for overall thermal state, not the panel
            temperature. The panel is rated 70 C (see box-4.3-ux-spec.md
            §335) but the die always runs hotter than the glass, by an
            amount that depends on the enclosure and the load. Calibrate
            against a real soak test and set this to whatever die reading
            corresponds to the panel approaching its own limit.

endmenu

config PK_SDMMC_VERBOSE
    bool "microSD: 放开 sdmmc 底层日志（排障用）"
    default n
    help
      打开后 sdmmc_req / sdmmc_cmd / sdmmc_common / vfs_fat_sdmmc /
      SD_HOST / sdmmc_periph 全部降到 DEBUG。正常运行会刷屏，但热插拔
      挂不上时它们是唯一的线索来源（卡的 CID/CSD、命令超时、时钟协商）。
